# WRPC shell command documentation

This directory generates the WRPC shell command list from the `wrpc-sw`
source code.

## Generated files

The generator reads:

- `../../include/cmds.h` for the registered shell commands and their Kconfig conditions.
- C files in `../../shell`, `../../dev`, and `../../lib` for `@shellcommand` and `@shellusage` documentation.

The build produces:

- `build/wrpc_shell_commands.tex`, a LaTeX fragment used by the WRPC manual.
- `build/wrpc_shell_commands_doc.pdf`, a standalone PDF containing the command list.

Generated files are placed in `build/`.

## Usage

From this directory, run:

```sh
make
```

To remove generated files, run:

```sh
make clean
```

When adding or changing a shell command, keep its `@shellcommand` and
`@shellusage` documentation next to the implementation. The generated list
will be updated when the command source is rebuilt.
